  "reviewCaveats": [
    "Partial appearance audit; unnamed settings, incidental ships and unsupported parent-world identities omitted.",
    "Skara Nal is retained as a surface site because the gallery uses the name for both world and structure. Safa Toma Raceway has no inferred parent world.",
    "Wayland/Weyland retain the existing Wayland ID; Metamorphosis ice-planet wording is not adopted as terrain evidence.",
    "Balmorra is orbital only. Finale Pabu is a proposed retirement, not an arrival. Kamino recollections and destruction evidence are not current surface visits."
